  dialogues:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: CONNIE_Hello
      Value:
      - "<wave><color=red>Hey, pal.,</color>\nTest\n\xA4<wave><color=red>TestTwo</color>"
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ABBIE_Hello
      Value:
      - Hi... I'm new here. I hope everything is alright?
      - Bonjour
    - Key: MAX_Hello
      Value:
      - Good morning!
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ROSA_Hello
      Value:
      - Hello dear!
      - "Bonjour mon ch\xE9rie"
    - Key: LI_Hello
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new. Uh\u2026 hi."
      - "Hey pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t do that
        again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new friends?\xA4Not
        much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five
        if you count Esteban; though the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem neither
        does Devi to be honest.\xA4And Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of
        the bunch.\xA4All smiles and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when
        you least expect it.\xA4Again I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s
        a shark tank here and you wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go
        just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
    - Key: DEVI_Hello
      Value:
      - "\u2026What? Is there something on my face?"
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_DayOne
      Value:
      - ...Backlog.
      - 
    - Key: LI_DayTwo
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new.\n\n\xA4Uh\u2026 hi."
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_DayTwo
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=Happy>Hey, fella!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You\u2019re new here,\nam
        I right?\n\n\xA4\u2026eh, who am I kidding.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>'Whole
        floor knows about\nour little newcomer!\n\n\xA4Sorry, 'guess that wasn\u2019t
        the\nwarm welcome you expected\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Ah, don\u2019t
        blame them.\nEverybody\u2019s on edge lately.\n\n\xA4Thought I\u2019d at
        least come by\nand greet you properly.\n\n\xA4Anyway, took enough of your
        time.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>See you tomorrow, pal!"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_DayTwo
      Value:
      - ...
      - 
    - Key: MAX_DayTwo
      Value:
      - "Oh! <!wait=1>Sorry for surprising you.\n\n\xA4I did not expect to see a
        new face here.<!wait=1>\nForgot you were replacing <wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\n\n\xA4A
        shame. <!wait=1>I quite liked her. \n<!sprite=Wink>Though I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll
        fit right in as well!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You know,<!wait=0.5> I think
        you\u2019re gonna bring \nsome much-needed life up here.\n\n\xA4Floor was
        getting pretty dull \nwith only the four of us.\n\n\xA4\u2026<!wait=0.5>Five,
        if you count Esteban, though \nthe guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\n\n\xA4Ahem,<!wait=0.5>
        neither does Devi,<!wait=0.5> to be honest.\n\n\xA4Anyway,<!wait=0.5> nice
        to meet you! \n\n\xA4Don\u2019t worry,<!wait=0.5> I probably \nwon\u2019t
        make your job too hard. \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Wink>Haven\u2019t failed a single
        report ever since I joined,<!wait=0.5>\nand I well intend to continue!\n\n\xA4See
        you tomorrow!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_DayThree_Good
      Value:
      - "Hey, pal!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Thanks for covering \nmy ass yesterday.\n\n\xA4Knew
        you were \na real mate.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Really appreciate it. And
        you \nknow I\u2019ll return the favour.\n\n\xA4<sprite=Happy>So! Met any
        new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max earlier.\nI\u2019d be careful
        in your place.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>All smiles, and just ready to plant
        \na dagger in your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again, I\u2019d
        be wary of who you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here, and you wouldn\u2019t
        believe \nthe lengths some people go just to earn a promotion.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Glad
        you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_DayThree_Bad
      Value:
      - "Hey, pal!\n\n\xA4Nice one the other day.\nVery funny.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Surprised>\u2026Don\u2019t
        do that again?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>But hey. \nNo offence taken.\n\n\xA4<sprite=Happy>So!
        Met any new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max earlier.\nI\u2019d be
        careful in your place.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>All smiles, and just ready
        to plant \na dagger in your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again,
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here, and
        you wouldn\u2019t believe \nthe lengths some people go just to earn a promotion.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Glad
        you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_DayThree
      Value:
      - "\u2026\n\n\xA4\u2026What? Is there something \non my face?"
      - 
